+
+```bash
+rsync -a --delete \
+  --exclude=palace/ \
+  --exclude=knowledge_graph.sqlite3 \
+  --exclude=config.json \
+  --exclude=backups/ \
+  ~/.mempalace/ user@host:.mempalace/
+```
