+
+```bash
+mempalace-code preflight mirror --command \
+  "rsync -a --delete --exclude=palace/ --exclude=knowledge_graph.sqlite3 \
+   --exclude=config.json --exclude=backups/ ~/.mempalace/ user@host:.mempalace/"
+# OK
+```
+
